# Keeps this preview deployment out of search results.
#
# Deliberately NOT a robots.txt Disallow: that would stop crawlers fetching the
# page at all, so they'd never read this header — and the URL can still be
# indexed from an external link. X-Robots-Tag is the mechanism that actually
# guarantees the page never appears in search results.
#
# Remove this file if the site ever becomes the official cdce.pdn.ac.lk.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
